V2, 4080 locked, same client (Anthropic Messages API, streamed, greedy, 128 tokens, no prefix cache), 5 passages x 3 rounds per length, medians.
vLLM 0.8B: run with enable_thinking true (vllm-think/), as Herbert and llama-server render the prompt; the first vLLM 0.8B run (template default, thinking closed, +2 tokens) is in http-vllm-0.8B.json.

